Error [E0927]: `#Tested` isn't a known applied rule
  --> tests/ui/marker_tested_at.jet:2:2
    |
  2 | #Tested
    |  ^^^^^^
 Why: `Tested` isn't registered as an applied rule — Jet rules are a closed, registered vocabulary (I7), not any PascalCase word.
 Fix: Did you mean `#Test`?
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0927

